sequenceDiagram
  participant Gov as Runtime Governor
  participant Itachi
  participant Shisui
  participant KOTO
  participant Exec as Executor
  participant Verify as Independent Verifier
  participant Izanami
  participant Izanagi
  Gov->>Itachi: Mission, verified state, budget
  Itachi-->>Gov: Plan, assumptions, contingencies
  Gov->>Shisui: Decision context and plan
  Shisui-->>Gov: Diagnosis and evidence gaps
  opt Intervention warranted
    Gov->>KOTO: Diagnosis and authorized scope
    KOTO-->>Gov: Transparent bounded intervention proposal
  end
  Gov->>Gov: Enforce policy / approval gate
  Gov->>Exec: Approved action
  Exec-->>Gov: Receipt and observations
  Gov->>Verify: Test actual success predicate
  Verify-->>Gov: Verified / unverified with evidence
  Gov->>Izanami: Recent actions, progress and evidence delta
  Izanami-->>Gov: Clear / watch / stagnant
  alt Verified success
    Gov->>Gov: Record terminal success and stop
  else Stagnation or contradiction
    Gov->>Izanagi: Verified state and recovery constraints
    Izanagi-->>Gov: Restore, compensate, reconstruct or escalate
    Gov->>Itachi: Replan from verified current state
  end
